e layout control.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['programming', 'css', 'web']),\n    },\n    {\n      title: 'Fermentation and Pickling',\n      body: 'Fermentation preserves food using beneficial bacteria. Sauerkraut, kimchi, kombucha, and yogurt are popular fermented foods. Basic lacto-fermentation needs only vegetables, salt, and water. Maintain proper salt ratios (2-3%), keep vegetables submerged, and ferment at room temperature for optimal results.',\n      tags: JSON.stringify(['cooking', 'fermentation', 'preservation']),\n    },\n  ];\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":18,"oldLines":6,"newStart":18,"newLines":34,"lines":["     )","   `);"," ","+  // Full-text search index over note titles and bodies (FTS5).","+  // Uses an external-content table linked to `notes` so the index stays","+  // compact; triggers below keep it synchronized with CRUD operations.","+  db.exec(`","+    CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE IF NOT EXISTS notes_fts USING fts5(","+      title,","+      body,","+      content='notes',","+      content_rowid='id'","+    );","+  `);","+","+  // Keep the FTS index in sync with the notes table.","+  db.exec(`","+    CREATE TRIGGER IF NOT EXISTS notes_ai AFTER INSERT ON notes BEGIN","+      INSERT INTO notes_fts(rowid, title, body) VALUES (new.id, new.title, new.body);","+    END;","+","+    CREATE TRIGGER IF NOT EXISTS notes_ad AFTER DELETE ON notes BEGIN","+      INSERT INTO notes_fts(notes_fts, rowid, title, body) VALUES ('delete', old.id, old.title, old.body);","+    END;","+","+    CREATE TRIGGER IF NOT EXISTS notes_au AFTER UPDATE ON notes BEGIN","+      INSERT INTO notes_fts(notes_fts, rowid, title, body) VALUES ('delete', old.id, old.title, old.body);","+      INSERT INTO notes_fts(rowid, title, body) VALUES (new.id, new.title, new.body);","+    END;","+  `);","+","   return db;"," }"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
